00:10:32.526 --> 00:10:35.125
And for
communicators that can feel rude But

00:10:35.125 --> 00:10:39.121
not doing that is being rude
to the rest of the audience.

00:10:39.121 --> 00:10:44.718
So you have to be very aware of not just
how you treat the troublesome individual,

00:10:44.718 --> 00:10:47.203
but all the others in the audience.

00:10:47.203 --> 00:10:50.503
[MUSIC]

00:10:50.503 --> 00:10:54.409
A wonderful mindset to have when
